{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Byte Wars</strong> is a <strong>strategic top-down rocket shooter</strong> where every shot counts. Take control of a spacecraft, rotate to aim, and launch a single rocket at a time, carefully navigating the pull of nearby planets that warp your trajectory in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players pilot a ship and fire one rocket at a time, requiring careful aim, as gravity from nearby planets dynamically alters rocket trajectories. Think before you shoot: accuracy  are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete in real-time Elimination and Team Deathmatch modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Plan your rockets around planetary fields that curve and twist their paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Progression</strong> \u2013 Earn score and climb the leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Equip your ship with visual cosmetics and power-ups for a personal edge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Byte Wars</strong> offers a unique, thoughtful twist on arcade shooting action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2396170?t=1753182270","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396170/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753182270","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396170/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753182270","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396170/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753182270","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9}